message: "If you use this construction or exact verification archive, please cite Version 2.0.0."
title: "A four-parameter family of reversible three-species mass-action continua without a common factor"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-02
authors:
  - family-names: Kriebel
    given-names: Alec
keywords:
  - chemical reaction network theory
  - mass-action kinetics
  - weak reversibility
  - positive steady states
  - computational algebra
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An exact four-dimensional positive cone of rates on one reversible,
  connected, three-species reaction support. Every rate in the cone preserves
  the same compact positive conic of equilibria in the unique compatibility
  class, while coordinate gcd one holds on a nonempty Zariski-open subset of
  the family. The archive includes exact family, radical, integer-optimality,
  stability, and minimality certificates. No Version 2 DOI had been minted at
  release-candidate freeze time.
